"template_override": 1, "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "frn3le03ob04re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\u00c9crivez sur une \u00e9mission t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9e que vous avez regard\u00e9e. Parlez \u00e0 votre camarade de votre \u00e9mission pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Consignes : Compl\u00e9tez les \u00e9tapes suivantes. Remplissez la grille d'auto-\u00e9valuation.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "frn3le03ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn3le03ob04re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "frn3le03ob04re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "frn3le03ob04re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jean</span> : Merci pour la boisson rafra\u00eechissante, Charlotte. J'avais tr\u00e8s soif !</br><span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Pas de probl\u00e8me. Il fait si chaud dehors.</br><span class=\"strong\">Jean</span> : Qu'est-ce que tu fais ce soir ?</br><span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Et bien,  l'\u00e9mission pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e que j'aime regarder est diffus\u00e9e ce soir.</br><span class=\"strong\">Jean </span>: Quelle \u00e9mission ?</br><span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : <span class = \"italic\">Envoy\u00e9 Sp\u00e9cial</span>. Coraline la regarde aussi tout le temps. Nous adorons regarder cette \u00e9mission. Ils ont de bons reportages.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "frn3le03ob04re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jean</span> : Je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re les \u00e9missions de t\u00e9l\u00e9-r\u00e9alit\u00e9 comme <span class = \"italic\">Secret Story</span>. </br><span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Oh, j'ai un peu regard\u00e9 ce programme la semaine derni\u00e8re, mais j'ai chang\u00e9 de cha\u00eene.</br><span class=\"strong\">Jean</span> : Pourquoi ?</br><span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Je pense que c'est ennuyant. Les candidats \u00e9taient \u00e0 la plage toute la journ\u00e9e.</br><span class=\"strong\">Jean</span> : Et bien, peut-\u00eatre qu'ils \u00e9taient fatigu\u00e9s et avaient faim ! Moi, j'ai vraiment ador\u00e9 ce programme.</br><span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : J'aime regarder les films d'horreur et les films dramatiques aussi. C'est plus int\u00e9ressant.", "id": 2, "time": "21500"}, {"image": "frn3le03ob04re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jean</span> : \u00c0 quelle heure arrive Coraline ?  </br><span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : \u00c0 18h. Nous allons acheter de la pizza au fromage et des boissons avant que le programme commence.</br><span class=\"strong\">Jean</span> : Est-ce que je peux venir ?</br><span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Tu d\u00e9testes <span class=\"italic\">Envoy\u00e9 Sp\u00e9cial</span>, tu t'en souviens ?</br>", "id": 3, "time": "46000"}]}}], "id": 2}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "frn3le03ob0